        "parms": "5. midiout opens its port when the first message arrives, and that first message is lost. So loadbang sends allnotesoff as the patch opens, and the port is ready before you click. allnotesoff is controller 123 on all 16 channels: it stops every note on a device that obeys it.",
        "type": ".text"
